            "value": "確認待ち"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Website": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Web サイト"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Websites": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Webサイト"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wednesday": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "水曜日"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wednesdays at %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "毎週水曜日 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What this writes": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "書き込まれる内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "実行タイミング"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "場所"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where the browser extension may fill this item. Subdomains of the same site count; a different scheme or port does not.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ブラウザ拡張機能がこの項目を入力できる場所です。同じサイトのサブドメインは対象になりますが、スキームやポートが異なる場合は対象外です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While you were away": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不在中の出来事"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "実行者"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With this on, this account's second factor no longer protects it from anything on this Mac: whoever can drive this job's browser during a run gets the password and a valid code together. It still protects the account if the password leaks from the service.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "これをオンにすると、このアカウントの 2 要素認証は、この Mac 上のものに対しては保護になりません。実行中にこのジョブのブラウザを操作できる者は、パスワードと有効なコードを同時に入手できます。パスワードがサービス側から漏洩した場合には、引き続きアカウントを保護します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without a folder the vault stays on this Mac until you choose one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "フォルダを選ぶまで、保管庫はこの Mac 上にのみ保存されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Word list": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "単語リスト"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Words": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "単語数"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Words are drawn from the EFF long list — %lld words, so each one is worth 12.9 bits.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "単語は EFF long list(%lld 語)から選ばれるため、1語あたり 12.9 ビットに相当します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write new notes in place of the stored ones": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存済みのメモを新しいメモで置き換えます"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "XXXX-XXXX-…": {
      "shouldTranslate": false
    },
    "You": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "あなた"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You chose Deny and block": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「拒否してブロック」を選択しました"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You will save an invitation file and get six words. Send the file, and tell the words another way — in person or on a call.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "招待ファイルを保存し、6 つの単語を受け取ります。ファイルを送り、単語は別の方法で伝えてください — 直接会うか、通話で。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your browser launches this. It holds no vault and decides nothing — it forwards messages to this app, which is where every check happens.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ブラウザがこれを起動します。保管庫は持たず、何も判断しません — メッセージをこのアプリに転送するだけで、すべての確認はこのアプリで行われます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your master password protects everything. kagisecure cannot reset it — that is what the one-time recovery code you are about to see is for.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "マスターパスワードはすべてを保護します。kagisecure ではリセットできません。そのために、これから表示される一度限りのリカバリーコードがあります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your vault key is wrapped by a key held in this Mac's Secure Enclave. Adding or removing a fingerprint invalidates it and you will be asked for your master password again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保管庫の鍵は、この Mac の Secure Enclave にある鍵で保護されています。指紋を追加または削除するとこの鍵は無効になり、マスターパスワードの入力を再び求められます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "a Mac": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mac"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "a browser this app could not name": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "このアプリが特定できないブラウザ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "a command": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "コマンド"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "a login": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ログイン"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "a one-time code — not the password": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ワンタイムコード — パスワードではありません"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "a page": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ページ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "a pinned program or file changed": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "固定されたプログラムまたはファイルが変更されました"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "a value it releases changed outside the app": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "渡す値がアプリの外部で変更されました"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "an environment": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "環境"
          }
        }
      }
